# ACL used by PublishMalformedTopicBufferLeakIT
# Grants write permission on the exact topic /finance/ibm.
# A specific (non-wildcard) ACL topic is required to trigger the NPE:
# AuthorizationsCollector.matchACL calls topic.match(aclTopic) where aclTopic
# has tokens [EMPTY,"finance","ibm"].  The loop accesses msgTokens.size() before
# returning, which throws NullPointerException when the publish topic is invalid
# (token list is null due to ParseException).  A wildcard '#' ACL would instead
# short-circuit via the MULTI branch and never reach that line.
topic write /finance/ibm
